OL,3,GNEWSATests carried out on seabirds
OL,4,Aafter nurdle spill
OL,5,
OL,6,FResearch is being carried out to find
OL,7,Fout how a microplastic spillage has
OL,8,Faffected coastal sea bird populations.
OL,10,FOn 19 July tonnes of microplastics
OL,11,Fknown as nurdles were spilled into the
OL,12,FRiver Tyne following a collision
OL,13,Fbetween ships at the Port of Tyne.
OL,15,FA series of necropsies are now taking
OL,16,Fplace at the Dove Marine Laboratory in
OL,17,FCullercoats on dead birds gathered
OL,18,Fafter the spill.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
