OL,3,GNEWSATests carried out on seabirds
OL,4,Aafter nurdle spill
OL,5,
OL,6,FDan Turner, coordinator at North East
OL,7,FEngland Beached Bird Surveys said:
OL,8,F"We've already seen samples from
OL,9,Fcontents of stomachs of suspected
OL,10,Fregurgitation which contain nurdles."
